	(text_box "high side current sense for every rail. INA219 or discrete opamp based curent shunt monitor.\ninterface to stm32 w i2c, calcaulte real time efficiency.\nmission control dashboard for payloads power consumption.\n\nlatch up protection. eFuse or HOT SWAP controller circuit w fet and comparator.\n\nemi and signal integrity. "
