	(text_box "TELEMETRY\n\nPGOOD: open drain sig from IC to MCU that rail is within target\n\nISENSE: across shunt\n\nQSENSE: if temp > 85C (qual?) in vacc, MCU automatically Load Sheds (shut down payload). "
		(exclude_from_sim no)
